xnu 0128: SPI through the SE DMA engine, because FIFO is disabled

0126 measured GENI_IF_DISABLE_RO = 1: this SE has the FIFO interface off, so
a FIFO command stays active for ever (GENI_STATUS bit 0 set, no error, empty
FIFOs). Move the transfer to the SE's own DMA: one contiguous page, TX at
offset 0 and RX at 64, physical address from pmap_find_phys, cache clean and
invalidate around the transfer, SE_DMA_TX/RX pointer/length/attr registers,
DMA mode, then the same TX/RX command.

The probe now does the two product-id framings directly (the loopback said
nothing on a master whose MOSI is not wired to MISO) and prints the DMA
status words next to the command status.

